5,1,1,talk,George,,Hello everyone. It seems our current arrangement isn't working. I think we should look at the facts before we decide on a new system.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We need a logical approach to avoid repeating the same mistakes. Let's be precise about what we investigate.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,It's important that the new system actually works for our daily needs. I'm interested in the practical side of using the car.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We should make sure the financial side is fair so that no one feels they are carrying an unfair burden.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I'm curious about how we've been doing things! I want to know the real numbers so we can all be happy and fair.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"I'll look into ""What two other car-sharing households said"" and ""The spell of checking each other's figures."" I want to know what causes these groups to fail.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I'll check the ""Month's trial of recording every run"" and ""Weeks of heavy use over the year"" to see how much time we actually spend coordinating.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I'll examine the ""State of the car at handover"" and ""Trips that repeat weekly."" I want to see why the midweek routine is so unstable.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'll look at ""Last year's tax, insurance and parking papers"" and ""Last year's fuel receipts"" to get a clear picture of the costs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I'll check ""Hours of use recorded in the diary"" and ""Last year's fuel receipts"" too! I want to see who drives the most.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
