34,2,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,George,,It seems that asking for favors and clinging to unnecessary turns are the main things that sour these arrangements. We should avoid that.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The coordination is a huge time sink. Recording runs took an hour a week, and heavy use periods cost us entire evenings of planning.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"It's worse than I thought. The car is often returned with the fuel light on and rubbish inside, and our weekly repeats are collapsing.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The costs are significant. Fixed papers are over 280,000 yen, and the fuel spending is incredibly lopsided among us.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I found out that some people drive way more than others, especially on Saturdays! The fuel receipts show some of us barely use it.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, if the coordination is that draining, we need a system that removes the need for constant negotiation.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Exactly. Any system that requires us to ""square up"" every single trip is just adding more labor to our lives.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Misaki, if the fuel is lopsided, that explains some of the tension. But the physical state of the car is just as frustrating.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, I agree. A fair split isn't just about money; it's about the effort and the state of the vehicle.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,It's a bit sad that we don't know who is paying for what. I think we need a way to make it honest.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,I also found that checking each other's figures created a lot of resentment. We should avoid a system that feels like an accusation.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,That confirms my fear. We can't have a system that turns us into accountants or police officers.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"If we have fixed days, maybe the person responsible for the car on that day would ensure it's clean and fueled?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"A fixed share might be simpler, but we have to account for the fact that some people use it significantly more.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, that sounds like a good idea! If it's your day, you take care of it!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,We need to balance the need for fairness with the need for peace. Let's see what options we have.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I'm looking for the path of least resistance and lowest administrative burden.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I just want to know that when I need the car for my weekly trip, it's actually there and ready.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I want a system where the subsidy is transparent and fair based on actual usage.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,I just want us all to be friends and not worry about the money anymore!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
