60,3,1,talk,George,,We have three options. A is a booking calendar with distance-based costs. B is fixed day allocation with a fixed share. C is a primary keeper.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option A sounds like the ""accountant"" nightmare I want to avoid. Option B is much more stable and requires less daily coordination.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option B would solve my problem with the weekly repeats. I'd know exactly when the car is mine.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option B is simple, but Option A is the only one that truly addresses the lopsided fuel and usage I found.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option C sounds cozy, but maybe it's not fair to the person who has to keep the car?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, remember that checking figures soured the mood. Option A requires constant recording and checking, which is a risk to our harmony.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I strongly agree with George. Option A is a recipe for the same burnout and resentment we've already seen.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Victoria,,Option C puts too much burden on one person. Option B gives us autonomy and predictability.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@George, I see your point. If the process of being ""fair"" makes us hate each other, it's not actually fair.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minato,,I like Option B! It's like having your own special day with the car!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,George,,"Option B removes the ""asking for favors"" aspect that ruins these groups. It's the most sustainable for our relationships.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It's the only one that minimizes the administrative hours. I'm voting for B.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,It guarantees my midweek needs and assigns clear responsibility for the car's state. I vote B.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"While I worry about the subsidy, the peace of mind is more valuable. I'll vote for B.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minato,,I vote for B too! It sounds the most peaceful for everyone!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,George,,It seems we are in agreement. I vote B.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
